# OVOS Codename Registry
#
# Scheme: alphabetical sequence of IAU-recognised star names (single-word, unambiguous,
# culturally-neutral per IAU Working Group on Star Names).
# Each line is one name.  The pointer file codenames/CURRENT points to the active name.
# To advance the pointer run the propose-codename workflow (manual dispatch only).
#
# Rules:
#   - Names are consumed in order, one per stable codename cycle.
#   - A codename cycle groups one or more stable releases that belong to the same
#     OVOS roadmap milestone (e.g. the namespace-migration V2 wave).
#   - Do NOT reorder or delete names already consumed (pointer would break).
#   - Append new names at the end when the list runs low (< 3 remaining).
#
